// Counter-Strike objective data for dust2cyberiav4. Hot-reloadable: edit and
// save, then `site_debug` / the next TeamBrain tick applies it live; nothing is
// compiled in and no code owns these coordinates.
//
// Anchors are placed on the map's playable floor between the two team spawns.
// X/Y are the usable bomb-site areas; Z is only a hint. At runtime the server
// snaps each site's Z to the loaded collision floor
